   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Program Water Sewerage Small Municipal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of water and sewerage systems in communities of up to 75000 inhabitants in which the service provider has financial sufficiency. Also, for the projects to be elegible, beneficiaries have to present a Human Development Index below the national average. Additionally, there are components for improving the financial capacity of service providers and to support the development of sectoral policies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
